*.bak.*
backup/
备份/
archive/
归档跟踪表/
归档/
硬科学素材/采集_*/
硬科学素材/采集_*/raw/

# Python/runtime缓存
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# 敏感凭证（绝不上传）
*cookies*.txt
bilibili_cookies.txt
weibo_cookies.txt
